0	section	Talking to Davey
1	line	Player	Hello!
1	line	Davey	'Ello guv.
1	line	Player	Why are you not helping out the others?
1	line	Davey	Well you see, guv, I've got these unshakable religious convictions.
1	line	Player	And those are?
1	line	Davey	Well, it's like this, see. I used to do a bit of the old priestin' on the side.
1	line	Davey	You know, collectin' for repairs to the church roof, passing the collection plate, jumble sales, nicking the lead off the temple roof so they needed repairing again.
1	line	Davey	Real holy stuff, you know.
1	line	Player	That doesn't sound all that holy to me.
1	line	Davey	Well, that's because you're not a man of the cloth are you?
1	line	Davey	You are, in fact, what we refer to in layman's terms as a punter.
1	line	Davey	But anyway, all that priestin' left me with an unshakable faith in three things.
1	line	Davey	The power of good over evil.
1	line	Davey	The true glory of the human spirit.
1	line	Davey	And that I ain't goin out there with those things runnin' around.
1	action	end
