1	line	Captain Donnie	Arr! What be ye wantin?
1	line	Player	I, err, came to...
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	Tell you to leave.
2	line	Player	I have come to tell you to leave.
2	line	Captain Donnie	Ye have?
2	line	Player	Yes.
2	line	Captain Donnie	Hahahahahahahahahahahahaha!
2	line	Captain Donnie	Bwahahahahahahahahahahahaha!
2	line	Captain Donnie	Wheeze...wheeze...
2	line	Captain Donnie	Gadzooks [lad/lass], that be the funniest thing I've heard all day! Say it again!
2	line	Player	I have come to tell you to leave.
2	line	Captain Donnie	Stop [lad/lass]! I'll shatter me ribs!
2	action	end
1	option	Ask what you wanted.
2	line	Player	I've come to ask you what you want.
2	line	Captain Donnie	Whadda we want? 'Rum'! When do we want it? Now!
2	line	Player	So...if I were to give you 'rum' you would leave?
2	line	Captain Donnie	Not really [lad/lass]. If ye were to give us 'rum' we'd kill ye quickly, as opposed to over a few weeks.
2	line	Player	Oh...
2	action	end
1	option	Join your crew.
2	line	Player	I've come to join your crew!
2	line	Player	Err, I mean...
2	line	Player	Arr! Shiver me mainbraces and make them landlubbers walk the scurvy plank, Cap'n! I've come to join yer cut- throat, bilge swillin' crew! Also, arr!
2	line	Captain Donnie	Are ye quite done, [lad/lass]?
2	line	Player	Yes, for the time being anyway.
2	line	Captain Donnie	Well, ye'll be glad to know that after that little performance I'd be glad to have ye on me crew!
2	line	Player	Huzzah!
2	line	Captain Donnie	Course, I'll have te kill ye first.
2	line	Player	Oh...
2	line	Captain Donnie	Don't ye worry, [lad/lass]. After we take the island I'll have the boss haul yer body to the temple and...
2	line	Captain Donnie	Err, never mind.
2	line	Player	Never mind what?
2	line	Captain Donnie	Ferget I said anything.
2	action	end
