1	line	Player	So is that everything?
1	line	Captain Braindeath	No, [lad/lass], next ye'll need to go outside and catch five loads of Sluglings fer the brew.
1	line	Player	What? Sluglings? That's disgusting!
1	line	Captain Braindeath	Arr, [lad/lass], that it be.
1	line	Captain Braindeath	To a weak-stomached, knock-kneed landlubber...
1	line	Player	Why Sluglings?
1	line	Captain Braindeath	'Cos, [lad/lass] they're one of our super-secret ingredients! Yer not too susceptible to mind control are ye [lad/lass]?
1	line	Player	Why?
1	line	Captain Braindeath	Because they have been known te, well, influence people every now and again.
1	line	Captain Braindeath	I'm sure ye've got nothing te worry about!
1	cond	If the player has completed Sea Slug quest:
2	line	Player	They aren't related to those Seaslugs are they?
2	line	Captain Braindeath	No [lad/lass], we just call them 'Sluglings' 'cos of a long and convoluted story involvin' a metal pipe and three dead seagulls.
2	line	Captain Braindeath	Aye they're related! Tis a good job they'll starve if they tried te eat yer brains!
2	action	continues
1	line	Player	So what should I do with these Sluglings anyway?
