1	line	Captain Braindeath	And then ye...
1	line	Player	And then I...
1	line	Captain Braindeath	Pressurise 'em.
1	line	Player	Pressurise them?!
1	line	Captain Braindeath	Just a little.
1	line	Captain Braindeath	Look, we don't have all day, get movin'.
