1	line	Player	How could I kill my sluggy brethren...?
1	line	Captain Braindeath	Snap out of it, [lad/lass]! Yer in slug-shock!
1	line	Player	What? Who?
1	line	Player	Gah! Sorry about that.
1	line	Captain Braindeath	No problem. Well, now ye have just one more ingredient to grab, and then we can get this 'rum' flowin!
1	line	Player	Well, how far away will I have to go to grab it?
1	line	Captain Braindeath	Not far at all, [lad/lass]. Ye've just got to get it from the basement!
1	line	Player	Great! What is it?
1	line	Captain Braindeath	Hold yer horses, [lad/lass]! While ye was off gallivantin' with yer slimy aquatic playmates, the 'rum' achieved spiritual critical mass.
1	line	Captain Braindeath	To put it in terms ye'll understand: the brewin' equipment is possessed.
1	line	Player	Possessed!
1	line	Captain Braindeath	Don't ye worry yerself about it! This happens all the time.
1	line	Captain Braindeath	Well, to tell the truth, my lads are a little quicker off the mark, so it only happens occasionally.
1	line	Captain Braindeath	Not that I'm criticisin' yer performance, [lad/lass].
1	line	Captain Braindeath	Give the controls a couple of belts with this wrench.
1	line	Captain Braindeath	One of the lads did a little priestin' on the side before he came here. Get him to bless it and ye'll do fine.
1	action	end
